          "text": "OpenLedger Asia Tour hits Hangzhou TOMORROW! 🇨🇳\n(Less than 24hrs) : )\n\nWe’re bringing the energy, the ideas, and the global movement for decentralised AI to one of China’s most vibrant dev hubs. Expect an action-packed evening with dynamic speaker sessions, EXCLUSIVE AIRDROP access, and exciting offline and online raffles!\n\nJune 18 | 6:00 PM – 9:00 PM GMT+8\nRSVP: https://t.co/ftoTBXsvzs\n\nOFFLINE RAFFLE (Exclusive for in-person attendees ONLY)\n\n🐙 On-Site Airdrop Whitelisting Program\n \nHow? – Scan the QR code at the venue and fill out the form in detail to secure early access to our exclusive airdrops.\n\n🐙 Win Premium Gifts\n How? – Stand a chance to win a brand new Apple Watch, AirPods, or even an iPhone through our lucky draws. Just show up, scan, and stay tuned, your number might be called!\n\nONLINE Raffle (Exclusive for non-attendees ONLY)\n\n🐙We’ll be sharing a ton of photos and videos from the Hangzhou event, including a full live recording straight from the venue.\n\nHere’s how to enter the Mega Online Raffle:\n\n🐙Pick your favourite clip or photo from our TG/X gallery posts.\n\n🐙Tweet about it, your most creative version wins hearts.\n\n🐙Go back to our event post on X and comment with a line of your choice + your Tweet link (this step is a must).\n\n🐙Keep going, at a surprise hour, we’ll freeze the comments. The final 50 comments will unlock our biggest surprise yet.\n\nYou know the drill. Let’s make it count with our friends @OurTinTinLand\n\nFolks in Shenzhen, Chengdu, and Shanghai , we’ll see you on June 20, 21, and 22!"
